  {
   "id": "coralina-230425@major-2023-05-10",
   "gameId": "coralina-230425",
   "displayName": "Coralina (Free Remaster Update)",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-05-10T21:46:01.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi! Coralina's DEV here. I'm here today to present to you a high priority update: a remaster of the game. I've been working on this for a few weeks after I finished the DEMO for Chapter II, which is already available on Steam. The reason behind this free update is to improve the experience for everyone, upgrading the quality of this simple retro game. I know we just released the game, but I felt a need to upgrade what I made, I wanted to feel my job in this project complete. I'm really happy with this update, I'm feeling complete with my creation. The game is far from being perfect, but at least it gives me a sense of fulfillment.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "[This is the first time I post something here. Usually Rebecca is the one who answers feedback and posts the updates, she is also my Publisher. I'll try to be more present here.]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Well, now for the CHANGES in the GAME",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Tilesets are now visually prettier;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Upgraded and improved the icons for every character;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Add two new songs in the OST;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The writing and English translation was changed for the best, removing and adding some lines;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Most cutscenes have been redesigned;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some parts of the map received improvements;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added 3 new NPCs;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New artworks added;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reduced significantly the download size of the game;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now choose the language in-game!: [This post can be used to report bug and/or give feedback!]: Well, that's it. Thank you for reading this message. I greatly thank you all for playing Coralina and for having fun with the story. Stay good and take care! See you next time!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
